  "description": "Simple, beautiful, and easy to love, Alpha is designed for anyone seeking ebike enjoyment without excessive complexity.\nAlpha 2.1 includes:\n\nOptimized gearing for faster speeds (over Alpha II)\nUpdated frame accessory mounts (up to 3 water bottles on frame and fork)\nSimplified sizing - Small works for riders 4'9\"-5'7\" | Regular for riders 5'4\"-6'1\"\n\nImproved battery charge port and on-battery power button\n\nVvolt Aluminum Fenders included, not installed (unless you select for local pickup)\nRear Rack is NOT included in the purchase price.\n\nChoose from 5 modes of responsive pedal assistance and ride on. Alpha 2.1 is easy to love, no matter how you ride. It has a zero-maintenance belt drive, powerful hydraulic disc brakes, a SafeSpeed throttle system, and an integrated removable battery.",
